{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_143_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_143","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，王三月，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_143_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_143","textTraditional":"二、晉侯使郤犨來聘，己丑，及郤犨盟。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_143_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_143","textTraditional":"三、夏，季孫行父如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_143_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_143","textTraditional":"四、秋，叔孫僑如如齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_143_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_143","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}